    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nDoes Mannitol cause hyper or hyponatremia?\n\nEither, depending on situation\n\n(↑ Solute in serum ⇒ ↑ Osmotic draw from ECF ⇒ Dilution and hyponatremia)\n\n(↑ Solute in urine ⇒ ↑ Osmotic draw in tubular fluid ⇒ ↑ Water excretion ⇒ Concentration and hypernatremia)\n\n[Image: 15135ba75664b7d89cf96a6fbab21792b604d6f2f233b52c691d1a11cbe6dfba]\n\n2.1 - Acetazolamide, mannitol\n[Image: c346f1e1d5cb39cc059e5bd608d36a8812b1c3b530d0e01775017287fe4fe311]\n\n[Image: 61f8a0910486f3c71a4efb2db6dbb10d3bbc0bb7fb66229bb099924aa115e650]\n\n[Image: b76e775466426f4d4e1061c1f6bca824ec6b4d679966f6f7153af8a9243e768b]",
